---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Refund & Cancellation Policy · Blu Baby Show" description="Refund and cancellation policy for Blu Shop digital downloads.">
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Blu Baby Show</p>
      <h1>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: 18 November 2026</p>

      <h2>Digital products only</h2>
      <p>Everything in the Blu Shop is a digital download (PDF soft copy). Nothing is shipped.</p>

      <h2>All sales are final</h2>
      <p>Your file is delivered instantly after payment. When you pay, you ask for immediate access and agree that
        the order is final once the file is delivered. Because a download can't be returned, we don't offer refunds
        for change of mind.</p>

      <h2>When we will help</h2>
      <p>If your download link doesn't arrive, doesn't open, or you were charged twice for the same order, email
        <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a> with the email you used to order. We will send the
        file again or fix the problem; if we can't, we will refund that order in full through our payment partner,
        Dodo Payments (merchant of record).</p>

      <h2>Your legal rights</h2>
      <p>Nothing in this policy removes rights you have under the consumer law of your country.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Blu Baby Show · <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact page</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem); max-width: 720px; }
  .legal h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--blu-deep); }
  .legal a { color: var(--blu-d); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
